 "notes": "Koh Bida Nai, the inner of the two Bida limestone islets 2 km south of Phi Phi Leh, with Bida Nok 150 m to the south; coastlines from OpenStreetMap. Moorings, the archway swim-through, the three pinnacles of Fantasy Reef and the depths; descriptions from Phuket Dive Guide: the dive usually starts at the southern mooring, goes through the glassfish archway into a shallow hard-coral garden and on over sand and staghorn to Fantasy Reef, with a sloping drop-off of 7-25 m on the east side. Positions are approximate.",
